 the planet's atmospheric composition and observe the consequences.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/7eb939af0fcd24af393e6d2bf3f8c235.webp?t=1762785045\" width=600 height=59 /></span><br>A dynamic plot guides the galaxy's simulation while you are playing.<br>Your action and participation to some missions will influence, among other things, the course of global events. You can change, slow down or precipitate them.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1343010?t=1762785045","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/1b074686b8a101492c05798b713e78bf1ae9cae6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762785045","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/3cfecd19b026aea0eda553226b0e5a9a27df09c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762785045","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/3cfecd19b026aea0eda553226b0e5a9a27df09c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762785045","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3946780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"Antimatter is a strategy and RPG game in a simulated and living galaxy.<br>In command of your spaceship, trade, fight, explore, or rule an interstellar organization.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A procedurally generated and dynamic universe with thousands of systems to explore, where dozens of factions struggle for power or survival.<br></li><li>Take command of a spaceship, trade, mine, harvest, scavenge, produce, and participate in the simulated economy.<br></li><li>Manage an existing city or found new colonies and outposts on any planet.<br></li><li>Climb the political ladder of a commercial or sovereign organization.<br></li><li>Interact with AI characters who are living independent and simulated life in the Antimatter universe.<br></li><li>Terraform entire planets by altering their atmospheric compositions.<br></li><li>Fulfil missions for corporations, factions, or individuals, or unravel the secrets of this galaxy.<br></li><li>Get involved in the Antimatter Crisis and try to change the course of history.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/9e532b663b8908586c807d26106a06c7.webp?t=1762785045\" width=600 height=59 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/0710ee940c5114de647a941331c498c5.poster.avif?t=1762785045\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/0710ee940c5114de647a941331c498c5.webm?t=1762785045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/0710ee940c5114de647a941331c498c5.mp4?t=1762785045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A universe generated and simulated across billions of years, with thousands of systems and planets to explore and colonise.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/5cfba3efdb08116282855d45835709cf.poster.avif?t=1762785045\" width=598 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/5cfba3efdb08116282855d45835709cf.webm?t=1762785045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/5cfba3efdb08116282855d45835709cf.mp4?t=17